'''Overseer''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid black with three small green overseer eyes imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is green, and the handle is black with green cracks.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Overseer (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It derives from ROBLOX’s famous [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Overseer_(series) Overseer Series].

